FinStudio — Licence
===================

This project has two parts under two different licences. Please read both.


1. THE SOFTWARE  —  MIT Licence
-------------------------------

Applies to the source code only: the spreadsheet engine, the router and
renderers, the design system, the build configuration and the test
harnesses. In this repository that means the contents of `js/engine.js`,
`js/app.js`, `js/quizzes.js`, `js/reference.js`, `js/sharecard.js`,
`css/`, `src/`, `tests/`, and the build and workflow configuration.

