3. Note on the two-part arrangement
-----------------------------------

The split is deliberate. The spreadsheet engine and site framework are
genuinely useful to other developers and are given away freely. The
curriculum represents the substantial original work of the author and is
reserved.

If you prefer a single licence covering everything, replace this file — but
be aware that an unmodified MIT licence would grant everyone the right to
copy the lessons, which is precisely what section 2 is written to prevent.
